RpbqstJ9-e_-_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7120.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6tjRpbqstJ9-e_-",{"x":58,"y":59,"zoom":60,"background":61},0,8,1,"transparent","none","Send dad the perfect gift or card",[65,70],{"type":66,"text":67,"spans":68,"direction":69},"paragraph","Father's Day is just around the corner on June 21st, and there's no better time to show appreciation for the dads, grandads, stepdads, and father figures in your life.  ",[],"ltr",{"type":66,"text":71,"spans":72,"direction":69},"Whether you’re planning ahead or need a last-minute gift, we can make your Father's Day delivery quick, simple, and stress-free. From personalised Father's Day gifts to luxury treats, we can help make your gift-giving effortless and memorable. ",[],"card$3889ba75-c93a-417c-a64c-8ecd5590dabc","card",{"variation":76,"version":26,"items":77,"primary":139,"id":143,"slice_type":144,"slice_label":45},"listComponent",[78,91,103,115,127],{"title":79,"content":80,"icon":84},"Personalised Father’s Day gifts",[81],{"type":66,"text":82,"spans":83,"direction":69},"From embossed wallets and custom photo frames to monogrammed accessories and bespoke grooming kits, personalised gifts add a thoughtful touch that dads love.",[],{"dimensions":85,"alt":87,"copyright":45,"url":88,"id":89,"edit":90},{"width":86,"height":86},40,"User icon","fathers-day-gift-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fe46b1c07-9c5d-4878-bb23-783ae73ba32f_user.svg","Yh96FxIAACwA-Zsi",{"x":58,"y":58,"zoom":60,"background":61},{"title":92,"content":93,"icon":97},"Luxury Father’s Day gifts",[94],{"type":66,"text":95,"spans":96,"direction":69},"Treat your dad to the finer things in life. Think premium spirits, designer watches, high-end grooming products, or artisanal hampers.",[],{"dimensions":98,"alt":99,"copyright":45,"url":100,"id":101,"edit":102},{"width":86,"height":86},"Jewellery icon","fathers-day-gift-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F8d232cd2-4e3c-400e-9151-18cd24f3f98b_jewellery.svg","Yh96FxIAAC8A-ZsK",{"x":58,"y":58,"zoom":60,"background":61},{"title":104,"content":105,"icon":109},"Tech gadgets",[106],{"type":66,"text":107,"spans":108,"direction":69},"For the dad who loves his gadgets, consider wireless earbuds, smartwatches, or the latest tablet.",[],{"dimensions":110,"alt":111,"copyright":45,"url":112,"id":113,"edit":114},{"width":86,"height":86},"Laptop icon","fathers-day-gift-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Ff4479625-5e04-45e8-9a20-77fa5893b64e_laptops.svg","Yh96GBIAAC8A-Zss",{"x":58,"y":58,"zoom":60,"background":61},{"title":116,"content":117,"icon":121},"Hobby-inspired gifts",[118],{"type":66,"text":119,"spans":120,"direction":69},"Golf accessories, cooking tools, book subscriptions, or DIY kits make great gifts based on your dad’s favourite pastime.",[],{"dimensions":122,"alt":123,"copyright":45,"url":124,"id":125,"edit":126},{"width":86,"height":86},"Memorabilia icon","fathers-day-gift-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F803bf5b6-622b-46bb-9847-7f2d5e89b5e5_memorabilia.svg","Yh96FhIAACkA-ZsJ",{"x":58,"y":58,"zoom":60,"background":61},{"title":128,"content":129,"icon":133},"Gift cards",[130],{"type":66,"text":131,"spans":132,"direction":69},"When in doubt, gift cards for his favourite store or restaurant are a sure win.",[],{"dimensions":134,"alt":135,"copyright":45,"url":136,"id":137,"edit":138},{"width":86,"height":86},"Money icon","fathers-day-gift-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F41d7371a-386e-4d75-a28e-2ea118d1d0af_money.svg","Yh96FxIAAC8A-Zsd",{"x":58,"y":58,"zoom":60,"background":61},{"theme":140,"title":141,"description":142},"standard","Father's Day gift ideas: Find the best present for Dad","Looking for the perfect way to say \"thank you\" this Father’s Day? Here are some of the best Father's Day gift ideas that are sure to impress:","list_block$d1267740-cfb0-4a8c-863e-5c4f90ee13e3","list_block",{"variation":146,"version":26,"items":147,"primary":148,"id":187,"slice_type":188,"slice_label":45},"default-slice",[],{"title":149,"bodyText":150,"isEco":21,"PaddingTop":21,"PaddingBottom":21,"NoMarginBottom":21,"hasButton":39,"buttonText":173,"buttonLink":174,"image":178},"Why choose Evri for Father's Day gift delivery?",[151,154,158,161,164,167,170],{"type":66,"text":152,"spans":153,"direction":69},"Here’s what makes us a trusted choice for sending your Father's Day gifts in time for June 15th: ",[],{"type":155,"text":156,"spans":157,"direction":69},"list-item","End-to-end parcel tracking ",[],{"type":155,"text":159,"spans":160,"direction":69},"Upgrade to Next Day delivery for as little as 58p",[],{"type":155,"text":162,"spans":163,"direction":69},"International delivery to 200+ countries and territories from just £6.08 ",[],{"type":155,"text":165,"spans":166,"direction":69},"Free UK and international label printing at home or in-store ",[],{"type":155,"text":168,"spans":169,"direction":69},"Up to £20 free parcel cover, with options to increase up to £999 ",[],{"type":155,"text":171,"spans":172,"direction":69},"Dedicated tools for marketplace integrations and sending multiple parcels ",[],"Send a Father's Day gift today",{"link_type":175,"key":176,"url":177},"Web","530e913e-7c5e-46b6-8c0f-0947888cb8fd","fathers-day-gift-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fsend",{"dimensions":179,"alt":182,"copyright":45,"url":183,"id":184,"edit":185},{"width":180,"height":181},2000,1300,"A handful of parcels are being handed to a recipient at the door. Both the courier and recipient are clearly visible","fathers-day-gift-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6y_apbqstJ9-iMH_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9298.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C67%2C7801%2C5071&w=2000&h=1300","Z6y_apbqstJ9-iMH",{"x":58,"y":186,"zoom":60,"background":61},67,"feature_banner$128ea297-1cb8-43b2-b765-5e3019d6c9c9","feature_banner",{"variation":190,"version":26,"items":191,"primary":262,"id":269,"slice_type":270,"slice_label":45},"3Column",[192,214,234],{"Title":193,"Description":198,"Image":202,"Label":45,"UrlText":208,"Url":209,"buttonDataGtmTrack":45,"SecondaryButtonText":45,"SecondaryButtonUrl":212,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":45,"ShowAppDownloadCta":45},[194],{"type":195,"text":196,"spans":197,"direction":69},"heading3","ParcelShops ",[],[199],{"type":66,"text":200,"spans":201,"direction":69},"As a convenient addition to selected Post Offices, head to your nearest Evri ParcelShop. Book your delivery online and drop off at 9,000+ locations. No printer? No problem - print your label in-store for free. ",[],{"dimensions":203,"alt":204,"copyright":45,"url":205,"id":206,"edit":207},{"width":52,"height":53},"Evri blue ParcelShop sign hung from the ceiling of a store in one of the aisles. Stock on shelves is visible in the background.","fathers-day-gift-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJPZbqstJ9-Tf4_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2888.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6TJPZbqstJ9-Tf4",{"x":58,"y":59,"zoom":60,"background":61},"ParcelShops",{"link_type":175,"key":210,"url":211},"2601792c-c7a2-457f-b4e1-25baba11499e","fathers-day-gift-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Ffind-a-parcelshop",{"link_type":213},"Any",{"Title":215,"Description":219,"Image":223,"Label":45,"UrlText":230,"Url":231,"buttonDataGtmTrack":45,"SecondaryButtonText":45,"SecondaryButtonUrl":233,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":45,"ShowAppDownloadCta":45},[216],{"type":195,"text":217,"spans":218,"direction":69},"Lockers ",[],[220],{"type":66,"text":221,"spans":222,"direction":69},"Need to send a parcel anytime, day or night? Our 24\u002F7 Lockers are placed in handy locations across the UK, like supermarkets and petrol stations. Book online, scan your barcode on arrival and place your parcel in an available Locker when it suits you. ",[],{"dimensions":224,"alt":225,"copyright":45,"url":226,"id":227,"edit":228},{"width":52,"height":53},"Customer holding parcel and standing outside at an Evri Locker, watching as their label prints out","fathers-day-gift-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3033.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C17%2C8164%2C5429&w=1000&h=665","Z6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb",{"x":58,"y":229,"zoom":60,"background":61},17,"Lockers",{"link_type":175,"key":232,"url":211},"604f7488-1792-485b-a7e0-c39c9f6657ff",{"link_type":213},{"Title":235,"Description":239,"Image":243,"Label":45,"UrlText":249,"Url":250,"buttonDataGtmTrack":45,"SecondaryButtonText":45,"SecondaryButtonUrl":261,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":45,"ShowAppDownloadCta":45},[236],{"type":195,"text":237,"spans":238,"direction":69},"Courier collection ",[],[240],{"type":66,"text":241,"spans":242,"direction":69},"Let us come to you! Arrange for a Courier to collect your parcel straight from your doorstep, with collection available up to 7 days in advance. Book your collection online and we’ll give you a 1-hour window for when you can expect us. ",[],{"dimensions":244,"alt":245,"copyright":45,"url":246,"id":247,"edit":248},{"width":52,"height":53},"An Evri Courier handing a customer a blue slip to confirm the details of a doorstep parcel collection. The transaction is taking place in a block of flats","fathers-day-gift-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ69x-ZbqstJ9-pVM_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4535.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z69x-ZbqstJ9-pVM",{"x":58,"y":59,"zoom":60,"background":61},"Courier services",{"id":251,"type":252,"tags":253,"lang":16,"slug":255,"first_publication_date":256,"last_publication_date":257,"uid":258,"url":259,"link_type":19,"key":260,"isBroken":21},"YhYt5BIAACkA0Qf8","content-page",[254],"Our Services","arrange-a-courier-collection--local-parcel-pick-up--evri","2022-02-23T13:07:14+0000","2026-07-10T11:49:03+0000","courier-service","\u002Four-services\u002Fcourier-service","abbd6af3-9304-4ad0-bf55-c5de04186247",{"link_type":213},{"SectionTitle":263,"SectionDescription":268,"theme":45},[264],{"type":265,"text":266,"spans":267,"direction":69},"heading2","How can I send my parcel with Evri for Father’s Day? ",[],[],"article_link_module$866424cb-cd6c-43bf-99d0-c1e118818582","article_link_module",{"variation":146,"version":26,"items":272,"primary":273,"id":282,"slice_type":283,"slice_label":45},[],{"heading":274,"description":275,"image":276},"TRUSTED by our customers","We handle over 800 million parcels every year. Trusted by leading retail brands like Hello Fresh, John Lewis, Wayfair, Next and more - we've earned more 5-star Trustpilot ratings than any other UK carrier. Check out what our customers say about their experience below or see our Trustpilot reviews for more information.",{"dimensions":277,"alt":278,"copyright":45,"url":279,"id":280,"edit":281},{"width":52,"height":53},"View from the window of a house, an Evri courier is approaching and waving to a woman in the window. He is delivering a couple of parcels to the house.","fathers-day-gift-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zdE5bqstJ9-inh_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7995.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6zdE5bqstJ9-inh",{"x":58,"y":59,"zoom":60,"background":61},"trust_pilot$a5b6de43-67d3-4bc6-94ca-863db27f8609","trust_pilot",{"variation":146,"version":26,"items":285,"primary":323,"id":325,"slice_type":326,"slice_label":45},[286,310],{"questionTitle":287,"questionBody":288},"When is the last day or time I can send a gift to arrive in time for Father’s Day?",[289,299],{"type":66,"text":290,"spans":291,"direction":69},"If you’ve got a gift to send last-minute, we recommend sending it no later than June 17th for Standard delivery or courier collection to a UK destination. You can also upgrade to Next Day delivery for only 60p extra and drop it off before 12 pm on June 19th.",[292,296],{"start":293,"end":294,"type":295},80,90,"strong",{"start":297,"end":298,"type":295},248,257,{"type":66,"text":300,"spans":301,"direction":69},"For international parcels, we recommend sending your Father’s Day gift as early as you can to reduce the chance of delays at this popular time of year. Check our guide on how to send an international parcel for more information. ",[302,309],{"start":303,"end":304,"type":305,"data":306},171,206,"hyperlink",{"link_type":175,"url":307,"target":308},"fathers-day-gift-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fguides\u002Fhow-to-send-an-international-parcel","_blank",{"start":303,"end":304,"type":295},{"questionTitle":311,"questionBody":312},"What if my dad isn’t home when the parcel arrives?",[313],{"type":66,"text":314,"spans":315,"direction":69},"If your dad isn’t home, we’ll attempt to deliver up to 3 times or use a safe place. With tracking, a 1-hour delivery window and diversion options, your dad can stay informed and choose where he’d like his parcel to be kept while he’s out. ",[316,319],{"start":317,"end":318,"type":295},71,82,{"start":320,"end":318,"type":305,"data":321},72,{"link_type":175,"url":322,"target":308},"fathers-day-gift-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fguides\u002Fsafe-place",{"title":324},"FAQs about Father’s Day gift delivery","frequently_asked_questions$c23538c8-3273-4b98-889f-37edaa72bc35","frequently_asked_questions",[24,46,75,145,189,271,284],{"heroCardContent":329},[330],{"id":30,"uid":45,"url":45,"type":31,"href":331,"tags":332,"first_publication_date":34,"last_publication_date":35,"slugs":333,"linked_documents":334,"lang":16,"alternate_languages":335,"data":336},"fathers-day-gift-delivery.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22ZgVcQRIAACEApjZD%22%29+%5D%5D",[],[33],[],[],{"monotypeTitle":337,"heading":346,"headingSupplement":347,"subheading":348,"promoText":349,"headingInternational":350,"headingSupple